      "label": "coach_teacher_ecology_battleend_lose_00_00",
      "hash64": "7FEEC80545C9560F",
      "text": "Looks like I managed to really pull out all the\\nstops this time!\\c\\nI’m glad I could show you that your teacher\\nhas some life in him yet![VAR 0x0114(002A)]",
