          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 59,
      "label": "coach_teacher_ecology_randomtalk_02",
      "hash64": "2B971400F56908D0",
      "text": "Oops. I forgot to change out of my sandals for\\nthis visit...\\c\\nI’ll get yelled at for sure if Director Clavell sees\\nme walking around someone else’s school like\\r\\nI’m on vacation at the beach...[VAR 0x0114(002A)]",
      "flags": 4,
